# Terraform local state and cache — holds plaintext secrets (DB password,
# secret ARNs, etc.) since we're using local state for v1. Never commit these.
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/terraform.tfstate.*.backup
**/*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Real secrets — only the .example template is meant to be committed.
**/terraform.tfvars
!**/terraform.tfvars.example

# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed on purpose (pins provider versions).
